    {
      "text": "he seemed as one that mocked unto his sons in law, Gen. 19:14. Sarah saw the son of Hagar … mocking, Gen. 21:9. he hath brought in an Hebrew unto us to mock us, Gen. 39:14. said unto the ass, Because thou hast mocked me, Num. 22:29. thou hast mocked me, and told me lies, Judg. 16:10. Elijah mocked them, 1 Kgs. 18:27. came forth little children out of the city, and mocked him, 2 Kgs. 2:23. they mocked the messengers of God, 2 Chr. 36:16. With hypocritical mockers in feasts, Ps. 35:16. Fools make a mock at sin, Prov. 14:9. Whoso mocketh the poor reproacheth his Maker, Prov. 17:5. Wine is a mocker, Prov. 20:1. adversaries saw her, and did mock at her sabbaths, Lam. 1:7.",
